@dialpad/dialtone-tokens 2.1.2

no-layers CSS font urls are fonts/ so a bundled stylesheet finds the woff2 files beside itself. The published package uses ../fonts/ from css/no-layers/.

illustrations.css is local, in css/ and css/no-layers/. The published CSS package does not ship it. Published SVGs write var(--token) with no fallback. The local file matches that attribute and supplies the light-theme color.

icons/ is 626 SVGs. icons/globe.svg is new in @dialpad/dialtone-icons 5.5.0. The other icon SVGs match the previous set.
